    <section class="community-section reveal-section" id="community"><div class="community-visual"><img src="${webAsset('Pastel Glow Beauty Portrait.png')}" alt="Pastel Glow Beauty Portrait" loading="lazy"/><div class="conversation-note note-a"><span>MENSTRUAL HEALTH</span><p>“It helped to put the pieces together.”</p><small>Example conversation</small></div><div class="conversation-note note-b"><span class="conversation-dot">✳</span><p>You’re not the only one asking.</p></div><span class="community-art-label">A LITTLE MORE ROOM TO BE HEARD</span></div><div class="community-copy"><div class="section-label light"><span>03</span><span>COMMUNITY, WITH CARE</span></div><h2>Sometimes, knowing you’re <em>not alone</em> changes everything.</h2><p>Find thoughtful conversations, shared experiences and a sense of belonging. Join in at your own pace, with a community identity that can be separate from your profile.</p><button class="btn light-cta" data-route="community">Explore the community <span>↗</span></button><small class="example-disclaimer">Conversation preview is illustrative. Community posts are personal experiences, not medical advice.</small></div></section>
